---

This project bundles components from other projects at container-build time.
Those components are subject to their own licenses:

- ANTs (Apache 2.0): https://github.com/ANTsX/ANTs
- SynthStrip / FreeSurfer (FreeSurfer license): https://surfer.nmr.mgh.harvard.edu/fswiki/License
- ANTsPy, ANTsPyNet (Apache 2.0): https://github.com/ANTsX/ANTsPy
- PyTorch (BSD-style): https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch
- surfa (MIT): https://github.com/freesurfer/surfa

Users of the built container should ensure their use complies with each
bundled component's license.
